\PYG{l+s+sd}{    Delete, Escape, ArrowDown, End, Enter, Home, Insert, PageDown, PageUp,}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{    ArrowRight, ArrowUp, F1 \PYGZhy{} F12, Digit0 \PYGZhy{} Digit9, KeyA \PYGZhy{} KeyZ, etc. You can}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{    alternatively specify a single character such as \PYGZdq{}a\PYGZdq{} or \PYGZdq{}\PYGZsh{}\PYGZdq{}.}

